## How to try
1. Open `/simulator`
2. Click Sample
3. On R1: enable → conf t → int Gi0/0 → ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0 → no shut → end
4. On PC1: enable → conf t → int eth0 → ip address 10.0.0.10 255.255.255.0 → no shut → end → ping 10.0.0.1
5. Submit → Score tab should show ≥80% / 100%
